@* LatihanSoal logo (BRD-10, D-118): the owner's hand-inked column (Assets/pro-b-ink.svg and pro-b-white.svg, "Concept B"),
   a fluted pillar that stands on a stack of books, because practice is the pillar of success. Both asset files hold the
   same path in ink #14181C and white, so it lives once in wwwroot/img/logo-mark.svg (symbol "mark", fill="currentColor")
   and .logo-mark picks the colour: ink on the light theme, white on the dark one. The page references the file instead
   of inlining the 2 KB path in the header and the footer, so pages stay within the HTML budget (OPS-01) and the browser
   caches the mark. The viewBox is cropped to the drawing with 2 units of margin. The wordmark stacks LATIHAN over a light
   blue SOAL. favicon.svg and favicon.ico use the same mark. *@
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" data-testid="logo">
  @* The outer viewBox starts at 0 0 with the drawing's size: <use> fills it and the symbol's own viewBox crops the mark. *@
  <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 168.6 218.8" width="31" height="40" class="logo-mark h-10 w-auto shrink-0">
    <use href="/img/logo-mark.svg#mark" />
  </svg>
  <span class="flex flex-col text-base leading-none font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">
    <span class="text-slate-900">Latihan</span>
    <span class="text-[#1d9bf0]">Soal</span>
  </span>
</span>
